# The built SPA ui_embed.go embeds; made by `make -C core hello-web`, never committed.
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
# node_modules is a committed symlink to ../../../web/node_modules, not a
# directory: this package is a member of the core/web workspace but lives
# outside it, so Node, Vite and tsc resolving upward from here would never
# reach the workspace's hoisted node_modules. npm ci in core/web leaves the
# link alone.
